ass=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956770/extras/\u5185\u5bb9\u8ba1\u5212\u957f\u56fe-EN__1_.png?t=1750663229\" /></p><br><h1>Wishlist Now!</h1><p><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956770/extras/Wishlist_Moods.png?t=1750663229\" /></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When sentient robots get left behind by their creators, they <strong>form a civilization</strong> and imitate them <strong>through artificial emotions</strong>. Unable to control these emotions, a civil war breaks out which eventually breaks them up into three different factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Under the guidance of <i>Enigma</i>, a scientist looking to <strong>restore the former peace</strong>, players need to infiltrate enemy territory to take out the three factions leaders in one fell swoop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956770/extras/Moods_Title-EN.png?t=1750663229\" />\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against <strong>10 unique Bosses</strong>, all of which can <strong>change their behaviour depending on what you say to them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Confront bosses with different emotions and watch them become sad, angry or happy - all of which drastically changing the flow of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first boss might just try to melt you down if you insult her pride, but may also take it a little easier on you after receiving a compliment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find out how each boss reacts and use their emotions to your advantage!Strong emotions bring greater rewards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956770/extras/word_shape_battle.gif?t=1750663229\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956770/extras/Moods_Title2-EN.png?t=1750663229\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>17 \u00a0futuristic weapons</strong> and <strong>over 80 weapon-altering modifications.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extra Bullets: Let your bullets spawn additional small bullets and overwhelm your enemies with a swarm of projectiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explosions: Blow up your foes in numerous ways, make your explosions hit twice or turn them into atomic bombs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conditions: Freeze, burn, corrode and charm enemies, maybe even all at once.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create a unique build in every mission!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956770/extras/addin.gif?t=1750663229\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956770/extras/Moods_Title3-EN.png?t=1750663229\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> 6\u00a0Emotion-based classes</strong> with <strong>27\u00a0game-changing upgrades each</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sorrow</i> - Summon your robotic dog to distract enemies. Upgrade it to bite enemies, slow enemy bullets or become a magnet!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Love</i> - Shoot a charming Arrow. Enemies will worship you and temporarily fight their own. Upgrade it to deal damage, let enemies suffer conditions or make them hurt themselves!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each class offers many different approaches!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956770/extras/ALL_MAP_ALL_CHARACTERS.gif?t=1750663229\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956770/extras/Moods_Title4-EN.png?t=1750663229\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Base Building</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform a barren junkyard into a functional base of operations.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Recruit helpers</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet friendly robots and invite them to help your cause.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local Co-op Multiplayer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plug in controllers and enter bullet hell in teams of up to 4 players!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Mission into the 3 factions will be the same</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each region will shuffle up their rooms and enemies with every run. There's always something new to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956770/extras/ADD_EN.gif?t=1750663229\" /></p>","developers":["StickyStoneStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956770/9ccb27c270ebb0f51b35a8e52854328e63411bb5/header.jpg?t=1750663229","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2018-2025 Sticky Stone Studio GmbH <strong>All Rights Reserved</strong>.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</str